  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 4a.4 Residuals",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Residuals for ALL fits overlaid (semi-transparent), with reference lines at\n   5% amplitude and 3\\[Degree] phase \\[Dash] supports the reconstruction-accuracy claim (Fig. Sx).\n   Pass a single spec instead, e.g. goodSpecs[[15, \"Spec\"]], for one spectrum. *)\nDCTPlots`PlotResiduals[goodSpecs[[All, \"Spec\"]]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"118457\" data-output-id=\"13\" data-out-n=\"85\" data-sub-idx=\"1\" data-output-format=\"SVG\" data-output-is-graphics=\"1\" data-cell-idx=\"51\" data-sub-start=\"3\" data-sub-end=\"3\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[85]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><span class=\"vscode-wolfram-gfx-marker\" style=\"display:none;\"></span><img class=\"vscode-wolfram-svg-output\" data-wl-img=\"c:\\Users\\Bob Lansdorp\\Documents\\DCT\\img\\EAB_DCT_analysis\\wl_3axjt8075s5a.svg\" src=\"img/EAB_DCT_analysis/wl_3axjt8075s5a.svg\"/></div></div>",
